#: kiconedit.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "新視窗(&W)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"新視窗\n"
"\n"
"開啟新圖示編輯器視窗。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"新增\n"
"\n"
"新建圖示，可使用樣板或具體指定大小"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"開啟\n"
"\n"
"開啟已有的圖示"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"儲存\n"
"\n"
"儲存目前的圖示"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"列印\n"
"\n"
"打開列印對話框以列印目前的圖示。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"剪下\n"
"\n"
"剪下目前圖示的選出部份。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可同時選擇矩形與圓形）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"複製\n"
"\n"
"複製目前圖示的選出部份。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可同時選擇矩形與圓形）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"貼上\n"
"\n"
"將剪貼簿的內容貼上到目前的圖示。\n"
"\n"
"如果剪貼簿的內容大於現在的圖形，你可以將它貼至新視窗。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：如果您要貼上透明像素，你可以在設定對話框選擇「貼上透明像素」。）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "貼上成新的(&N)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "更改大小(&Z)..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"更改大小\n"
"\n"
"保持內容完整的同時平滑地改變圖形的大小"

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "灰階(&G)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"灰階\n"
"\n"
"將目前圖示灰階化。\n"
"\n"
"（警告：產生的圖形很可能含有圖示的色盤中沒有的顏色）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"放大\n"
"\n"
"放大一倍。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"縮小\n"
"\n"
"縮小一倍。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr ""

